  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: KoboldMechanist
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Kobold Mechanist
  role: 3
  description: 'A Kobold engineer who keeps the Empire''s war machines running. The
    Mechanist has the Kobold Militiaman''s stats but a little armor (5 health, Armor
    Level 1, 50% accuracy, 20 m a move) and fights alone (Solo), with a Fang Caster
    (the Draconis Assault Rifle: 4 damage, penetration 1, 20 m). Its Repair Kit restores
    10 health to a friendly Mechanical soldier within 5 m, such as a damaged Tyrant
    Hover-tank, as its action; it can''t be used on one at full health. Keep it close
    behind your machines and out of the line of fire. A Specialist, so you can field more than one.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ca0797d5612632f47b4939c4f22dffc8, type: 2}
